OL,3,GNEWSAThree men charged over football
OL,4,Adisorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe accused, aged 64, 54 and 37, were
OL,7,Fcharged with a public order offence
OL,8,Fafter being arrested at addresses in
OL,9,FWolverhampton, Willenhall, and
OL,10,FBirmingham. The 64-year-old was also
OL,11,Fcharged with obstructing and assaulting
OL,12,Fa police officer, West Midlands Police
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FA fourth man, aged 55, was arrested at
OL,16,Fa police station on suspicion of
OL,17,Faffray.
